	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Paulo longioris silentii mei, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, nulla alia caussa fuit, quam quod <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>toto hoc tempore non erat ad manum, quod scriberem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Erant quidem agendae <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tibi gratiae propter missam a te <persName ref="p714">Curionis</persName> elegantem simul et piam lucubrationem, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et literae amicorum, quibus me de rebus novis abunde erudiisti, tandem erant <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>remittendae.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed procrastinandum tamen hoc officium arbitrabar, donec haberem, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quod et ipse ad te scriberem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Igitur quum hac hora ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> literas a <persName ref="p2856">Saylero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>cognato accepissem, curavi illico, ut meae cum tuis commodato missis coniunctae <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>per <persName ref="p8127">Chuͦnradum</persName> nostrum, optimum virum et (ut mihi polliceor) ad vomitum non reversurum, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>pererendae demandarentur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Scribit autem <persName ref="p6355">Saylerus</persName> inter alia in haec <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>verba: "Im letzsten brief von <placeName ref="l15">Antdorf</placeName> schreybt man mir ouch, wie der amiral <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in <placeName ref="l830">Engelland</placeName>, ouch der möntzmaiser, auf 20. Marzo zuͦ <placeName ref="l296">London</placeName> gericht und <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>endthauptet worden etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Sol ob fünfzehenhunderttausend kronen wert und dess <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>alten konigs tochter aine schwanger hinder im verlaßen haben.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Aber kain <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ander particularitet wirt darneben gemelt, dann niemand gern zeytun<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>g schreybt, von wegen das alle brief am passagio ersuͦcht werdend.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Es sol teg<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>lich der Fukher diener ainer auß <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName> khomen; der wirt möndtlich sagen können, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>das man sonst nit schreyben darf.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Bin vertrost, was der ouch der religion halber <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>bringen werde, mir mit ersten anzuͦzaygen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Das sol euch allsdann ouch on<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>verhalten bleyben.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName>, den 10. Aprilis, imm 1549."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Haec ille ad me de amiraldo et magistro eius monetae; quae deinceps submittet, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>te non latebunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">De Caesare nihil, nisi quod parare se pedetentim videtur adversus <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>urbes maritimas <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName>, quae mirabili constantia retinendae pietatis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>coaluerunt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dominus faciat in illis signum bonae suae voluntatis et nostram <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tueatur; nam et in hanc parare ungulas suas aquilas illas cauda <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pavonina monstrosas certo certius existimatur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Proinde magna concordia <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut cohaereamus, res ipsa efflagitabit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName>, 14 die Aprilis, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>hora duodecima pomeridiana, anno 49.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro D. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, almae urbis <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> episcopo, domino suo colen<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>dissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
